{
  "description": "tikajs-u03v. Adapted from xberg (MIT) docx_content_control_placeholders.rs. Oracle Tika 4.2.0 /tika: the prompt text of an empty content control (w:showingPlcHdr) is written, as are filled controls (xberg expected the prompts dropped).",
  "tags": [
    "xberg",
    "docx",
    "ooxml"
  ],
  "input": {
